      "section": "At a Glance",
      "chunkIndex": 1,
      "chunkType": "text",
      "content": "At a Glance\nProduct Type 20-Year Level Term Life Insurance\nIssue Ages 18–60\nFace Amounts $100,000–$2,000,000\nPremiums Level and guaranteed for 20 years. After the level period, coverage is\nannually renewable at attained-age rates that increase each year; see\npolicy schedule. Coverage may continue to age 95.\nCash Value None. The policy does not accumulate cash value.",
